#: Api/Gql/Filestore.php:510
msgid ""
"This defaults to \"Passive\". If your FTP server is behind a seperate NAT or "
"Firewall to this VoIP server, you should select \"Active\". In \"Active\" "
"mode, the FTP server establishes a connection back to the VoIP server to "
"receive the data. In \"Passive\" mode, the VoIP server connects to the FTP "
"Server to send data."
msgstr ""
"此預設為「被動」。若您的 FTP 伺服器在此 VoIP 伺服器的個別 NAT 或防火牆之後，您應選取「主動」。在「主動」模式中，FTP 伺服器會建立連線回到 VoIP 伺服器以接收資料。在「被動」模式中，VoIP 伺服器會連線到 FTP 伺服器以傳送資料。"

#: drivers/FTP/views/form.php:245
msgid ""
"This defaults to 'Passive'. If your FTP server is behind a seperate NAT or "
"Firewall to this VoIP server, you should select 'Active'. In 'Active' mode, "
"the FTP server establishes a connection back to the VoIP server to receive "
"the data. In 'Passive' mode, the VoIP server connects to the FTP Server to "
"send data."
msgstr ""
